	(text "Module Vin = +3V3 keeps its logic at 3.3 V. NUF4001MU filters: 100 R in series to damp the cable, 13 pF and an ESD clamp on each side. Two channels of the second part are spare. The jack shield is tied to GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4ccfc293-1f0d-5411-910d-678fd328b3c2")
	)
	(text "RJ45 pin -> module pad: 1 SCL, 2 GND, 3 SDA, 4 Vin, 5 CS, 6 DO, 7 I1, 8 I2 (3Vo pad open). Pairs: SCK with GND, MOSI with MISO, +3V3 with CS, INT1 with INT2. Plain jack, no magnetics."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8dd9eef8-78ca-52c7-ad8d-e2703f3426ca")
	)
	(text "LSM6DSOX is the off-board Adafruit module (product 4438) on the cooler, cabled to J14 (RJ45, straight Cat5e cable) over the main SPI bus (CS from the decoder, INT1 GPIO2 single-tap, INT2 GPIO39 wake-up)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 15 0)
		(effects
